# Leadhub

Site-wide pixel in `Templates/default.twig` (pageview). Newsletter forms call `lhi('identify', { email, subscribe: ['newsletters'] })` — identifies the browser and joins the list in one event (Leadhub onboarding expects Identify).

| Item | Value |
|---|---|
| Tracking ID | `bQVrGwsJSGSpLS5` (override with `LEADHUB_TRACKING_ID` in `.env`) |
| Interest list code | `newsletters` (case-sensitive; key is `subscribe` on identify, not `interests`) |
| Form partial | `Partials/newsletter-form.twig` |
| Surfaces | homepage `.home-about__newsletter` (under Já), `/newsletter` |

Tracking ID is public (client JS). Confirm list code under Leadhub → Odběratelské listy if subscribe does not appear in Audience.
